<title>PAKISTAN: SOCCER-IRAQ BEAT PAKISTAN 6-2 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-IRAQ BEAT PAKISTAN 6-2 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LAHORE, Pakistan 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iraq beat Pakistan 6-2</p>
<p>(halftime 2-1) in their World Cup Asian zone first round group</p>
<p>nine qualifying match on Friday.</p>
<p>    Standings	     P   W   L   D   F   A  Pts</p>
<p> Iraq			 1   1   0   0   6   2   3</p>
<p> Kazakhstan		 1   1   0   0   3   0   3</p>
<p> Pakistan		   2   0   0   2   2   9   0</p>
<p>Note: Group winners qualify for second round</p>
<p>Remaining matches:  June 6 Iraq v Kazakhstan, June 11</p>
<p>Pakistan v Kazakhstan, June 20 Iraq v Pakistan, 29 Kazakhstan v</p>
<p>Iraq</p>
</text>
